    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set on an impressive c.1.64 acre site in one of County Meath's most desirable residential locations, this charming four-bedroom bungalow presents a rare opportunity to acquire a property with exceptional potential in a much sought-after area.\r\n\r\nThe property features a number of outhouses, offering possibilities for storage, workshops, hobby spaces, home offices or future conversion, subject to planning. The expansive grounds provide ample space for gardens and further enhancements.\r\n\r\nLocation is undoubtedly one of this property's greatest assets. Positioned on the highly regarded Fairyhouse Road, the home enjoys a peaceful countryside setting while remaining exceptionally well connected. The M3 Parkway is just minutes away, while the M3 motorway provides swift access to Dublin City Centre and the national road network. Dublin Airport is approximately a 20-minute drive, making this an ideal location for commuters and frequent travellers alike.\r\n\r\nA host of renowned local amenities are within easy reach, including the world-famous Fairyhouse Racecourse, offering year-round racing and events. The ever-popular Avoca, Dunboyne is just a short drive away, providing an excellent selection of cafés, artisan food, shopping and lifestyle offerings. The thriving towns of Ratoath and Dunboyne offer an excellent choice of schools, supermarkets, restaurants, sporting facilities and public transport, ensuring every convenience is close at hand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch| 1.8m x 3.3m Tiled floor\r\nHallway| 1.0m x 3.6m Wood flooring\r\nLiving Room| 3.4m x 3.8m Wood flooring, feature open fireplace\r\nKitchen| 4.0m x 3.1m \r\nBathroom| 1.8m x 2.8m Bath\r\nBedroom 1| 2.8m x 4.1m Wood flooring\r\nBedroom 2| 2.6m x 3.4m Wood flooring\r\nBedroom 3| 2.3m x 3.4m Wood flooring, fireplace\r\nBedroom 4| 2.2m x 3.2m Wood flooring, fireplace"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb Location, 2km from Dunshaughlin & 4km from Ratoath\r\nOn c.1.64 acres with possible further site potential\r\nNumber of Outbuildings"
      },
